I wander through the night， I think of you， When we run away， we turn the wheels of truth in all the memories

6625175
01:50:25,175 --> 01:50:49,254
When you wander through the dark， I will be there in your heart， And so it's for the best， That's where it all began， One day you'll understand， Until we meet again
